[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 362.39, "timestamp": "00:06:02", "text": "練習或複習今天的考試"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 365.83, "timestamp": "00:06:05", "text": "。幸好今天的考試，嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 369.83, "timestamp": "00:06:09", "text": "感覺就像……嗯，老師給了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 373.029, "timestamp": "00:06:13", "text": "時間限制。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 374.71, "timestamp": "00:06:14", "text": "我必須在明天上午10點之前提交"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 376.87, "timestamp": "00:06:16", "text": "。那就是最後期限。所以它就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 379.59, "timestamp": "00:06:19", "text": "一個PDF文件，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 384.71, "timestamp": "00:06:24", "text": "那些N5或Q5的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 387.029, "timestamp": "00:06:27", "text": "P類練習題樣本一樣，你知道，就是那種"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 389.27, "timestamp": "00:06:29", "text": "考卷樣本。對，就像那些一樣。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 389.895, "timestamp": "00:06:29", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "so its like a assignment??"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 391.749, "timestamp": "00:06:31", "text": "所以，我需要逐一瀏覽一下，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 395.749, "timestamp": "00:06:35", "text": "這裡有PDF 1和PDF 2。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 398.55, "timestamp": "00:06:38", "text": "PDF 2是詞彙和漢字。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 401.59000000000003, "timestamp": "00:06:41", "text": "PDF 版本會是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 405.51, "timestamp": "00:06:45", "text": "呃，該怎麼說呢？呃，PDF 版本大概是一些亂七八糟的東西，呃，所有的文法等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 411.749, "timestamp": "00:06:51", "text": "。  是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 416.469, "timestamp": "00:06:56", "text": "。基本上，N5 或 Q5 考試包括漢字部分、"}]